Also heard on I.A. No.16972 of 2024, which is second application for suspension of sentence and grant of bail on behalf of appellant Sandeep Kumar Gupta, who stands convicted under Sections 450, 376(1) & 306 of the Indian Penal Code and sentenced to undergo R.I. for one year with fine of Rs.500/-; sentenced to undergo R.I. for ten years with fine of Rs.1000/-; sentenced to undergo R.I.
for five years with fine of Rs.1000/-; and under Section 3(2)(v) of SC/ST Act and sentenced to undergo R.I. for life with fine of Rs.2000/- respectively with default stipulations as mentioned in the impugned judgment dated 28/07/2021 passed by learned Special Judge (POCSO) Act, Singrauli,
District Singrauli (M.P.) in Special Case No.38/2021.
